{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903880/extras/logo616.png?t=1647274696\" /><br>The sheep are hungry!<br><br>But they don't know how to find the grass on their own.<br>Push them to the grass so they can eat.<br>But be careful, you don't want one getting in the way of the other.<br><br>Push the sheep is a game where you have to think to solve the puzzles and proceed to the next level.<br><br>Each level more challenging than the next, and don't be fooled by the childish graphics, only the greatest geniuses are able to make it to the end.<br><br>Push all the sheep into each bush to win the stage.<br>You can only push, never pull, but don't worry, you still can undo every move you made.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903880/extras/ezgif-2-4f1dc0e06d.gif?t=1647274696\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1903880?t=1647274696","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1647274696","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1647274696","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903880/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1647274696","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903880/extras/logo616.png?t=1647274696\" /><br>The sheep are hungry!<br><br>But they don't know how to find the grass on their own.<br>Push them to the grass so they can eat.<br>But be careful, you don't want one getting in the way of the other.<br><br>Push the sheep is a game w